# Cloudflare Pages cache rules.
# There is no build step (the site deploys via Cloudflare's Git integration),
# so asset URLs never change between deploys. Everything must therefore be
# revalidated on each load: browsers send a conditional request and get a
# fast 304 when nothing changed, and fresh files immediately after a deploy.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
